{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49572","headline":"更漏子 二 · 毛熙震","name":"更漏子 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟月寒，秋夜静，漏转金壶初永。\n罗幕下，绣屏空，灯花结碎红。\n人悄悄，愁无了，思梦不成难晓。\n长忆得，与郎期，窃香私语时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛熙震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}